# HERO topic: "me vs. peers" in one place.
# Topic name = filename (saas_company_benchmark). Do NOT add a `name:` key.
label: "SaaS — Company vs. Peer Benchmark"
description: >
  A company's own metric value, its percentile rank within a chosen peer group,
  and the peer distribution (P25 / Median / P75 / P90 / Mean) side by side.
  Pick a metric (dim_metric.name) and a peer-group cohort (the Peer Group:*
  fields; '__ALL__' = rolled up). RESTRICTED to the viewing company.
base_view: fact_company_percentile_rank
joins:
  dim_metric: {}
  fact_company_usage_metrics: {}
  fact_benchmark_stats: {}
access_filters:
  - field: fact_company_percentile_rank.account_id
    user_attribute: account_id
    values_for_unfiltered: ['__ALL__']
